{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53073","headline":"和萧郎中游兰若 · 朱放","name":"和萧郎中游兰若","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱彼云外人，来取涧底泉。\n风吹芭蕉折，鸟啄梧桐穿。\n（见《十万卷楼丛书》本皎然《诗式》卷三。\n同书卷四录前二句。\n）（按：《全唐诗》卷三一五录四句，缺题，又末字「穿」作「落」，故分作二断句，盖沿《吟窗杂录》删节本《诗式》之误所致，今重录改正之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱放","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53073.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53073","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}